<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Menshykau & Iber (2013), Zubkov et al. (2015) & Watanabe & Costantini (2004) kidney ureteric bud GDNF-RET-Wnt11 Turing branching morphogenesis (Mus musculus (embryonic E11.5-E13.5 mouse metanephric kidney ureteric bud tree & metanephric mesenchyme))",
        "Menshykau & Iber (2013), Zubkov et al. (2015) & Watanabe & Costantini (2004) kidney ureteric bud GDNF-RET-Wnt11 Turing branching morphogenesis faithfully reproduces Mus musculus (embryonic E11.5-E13.5 mouse metanephric kidney ureteric bud tree & metanephric mesenchyme) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-1>,
