        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mus musculus (embryonic E11.5-E13.5 mouse metanephric kidney ureteric bud tree & metanephric mesenchyme) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.1/100, audit 2026-10-19-kidney-ureteric-bud-gdnf-ret-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2012-menshykau-fgf10-shh-lung-turing.py> ;
    schema:about "Mus musculus (embryonic E11.5-E13.5 mouse metanephric kidney ureteric bud tree & metanephric mesenchyme)" ;
    pk:aristotelianEfficientCause "6. Tip-Splitting & Flow Trees" ;
    pk:aristotelianMegistonGenos "I. Enaima (Vertebrata)" ;
    pk:aristotelianPoionForm "Bifurcating Vascular/Lung Trees" ;
    pk:aristotelianPosonLaw "Murray Law r_0^3 = r_1^3 + r_2^3" ;
    pk:aristotelianSubalternClass "Mammalia (Zootoka)" ;
    pk:biologicalGenus "Mus" ;
